<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:13.652" style="s2">Raymond.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.652" end="00:02:13.652" style="s2">We&#39;ve waited as long as we could.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.692" end="00:03:30.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawrence, let&#39;s let your daddy sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.842" end="00:03:36.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.462" end="00:03:39.482" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.172" end="00:03:51.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh-huh.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.092" end="00:03:51.892" style="s2">Yeah, thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.692" end="00:04:05.934" style="s2">Corner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.012" end="00:04:08.334" style="s2">Arrange for transport to meet us up</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.934" end="00:04:08.334" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.254" end="00:04:14.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.694" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.574" end="00:04:25.934" style="s2">All right. Well,</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.894" end="00:04:25.934" style="s2">we&#39;ll meet you up there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.718" end="00:04:58.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.614" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my mountaineer, buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:21.094" style="s2">I always talked about bringing you up</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.774" end="00:05:24.614" style="s2">here, but</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.094" end="00:05:24.614" style="s2">Mama didn&#39;t think it was worth [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.375" end="00:07:11.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll leave you to it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.055" end="00:07:28.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.215" end="00:07:31.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, buddy. It&#39;s just past your</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.295" end="00:07:32.015" style="s2">curfew.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.615" end="00:07:33.535" style="s2">Marty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.015" end="00:07:36.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raymond.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.535" end="00:07:38.695" style="s2">Good to see you, Raymond.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.255" end="00:07:40.375" style="s2">Glad I caught you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:42.815" style="s2">Hey there.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.375" end="00:07:43.375" style="s2">How you doing, buddy?</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.815" end="00:07:46.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.375" end="00:07:46.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.615" end="00:07:48.775" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, Marty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.015" end="00:07:51.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no, no, no. It&#39;s just going to</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.775" end="00:07:51.855" style="s2">take him some time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.535" end="00:07:55.655" style="s2">I don&#39;t want you to worry about</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.495" end="00:07:57.855" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.655" end="00:07:59.335" style="s2">She&#39;s in good hands, Raymond.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.855" end="00:08:00.895" style="s2">Got her the plot right next to your</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.335" end="00:08:03.175" style="s2">parents. I know you&#39;re going through a</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.895" end="00:08:05.455" style="s2">trouble time right now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.175" end="00:08:06.975" style="s2">But I want you to know that I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.455" end="00:08:08.217" style="s2">So is the Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.975" end="00:08:10.337" style="s2">You ever want to to me, my door is</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.217" end="00:08:11.457" style="s2">always open.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.337" end="00:08:11.937" style="s2">You did right bringing her back here,</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.457" end="00:08:13.577" style="s2">Raymond.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.937" end="00:08:15.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, look, that&#39;s enough. Just sit</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.577" end="00:08:15.977" style="s2">still.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.617" end="00:08:18.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Marty.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.217" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.697" end="00:08:20.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.297" end="00:08:22.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got to get going.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.017" end="00:08:22.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.897" end="00:08:32.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ew.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.057" end="00:08:32.977" style="s2">Where&#39;s Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.217" end="00:08:43.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Lawrence.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.657" end="00:08:46.377" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.857" end="00:08:46.377" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.337" end="00:08:50.337" style="s2">People like that,</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.177" end="00:08:52.657" style="s2">they&#39;re going to spend their whole lives</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.337" end="00:08:56.377" style="s2">trying to be original.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.657" end="00:08:56.377" style="s2">You, you&#39;re lucky enough to be born one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.017" end="00:09:03.017" style="s2">Get yourself some chips.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.657" end="00:09:13.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just don&#39;t look at it, baby girl.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.411" end="00:09:19.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.996" end="00:09:24.016" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.546" end="00:09:30.566" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.441" end="00:09:36.461" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.336" end="00:09:42.356" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.816" end="00:09:52.836" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.056" end="00:09:58.076" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.951" end="00:10:03.971" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.846" end="00:10:11.777" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.337" end="00:10:11.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.458" end="00:10:18.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Nana and Pop-Pop&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.338" end="00:10:18.178" style="s2">It&#39;s where I grew up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.218" end="00:11:53.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.058" end="00:11:58.618" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.298" end="00:12:01.458" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.218" end="00:12:06.578" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.458" end="00:12:08.418" style="s2">I don&#39;t understand what the [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.578" end="00:12:12.018" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.418" end="00:12:12.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Truck just came out of nowhere.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.578" end="00:12:16.739" style="s2">Just the middle the day.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.819" end="00:12:19.659" style="s2">Regular day.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.539" end="00:12:24.859" style="s2">I got on the first flight back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.459" end="00:12:28.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.139" end="00:12:32.299" style="s2">I&#39;m Samara.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.939" end="00:12:38.699" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.179" end="00:12:44.819" style="s2">Hi Lawrence. That&#39;s right. I&#39;m Officer</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.419" end="00:12:47.979" style="s2">Samara.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.819" end="00:12:47.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your aunt Carolyn.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.539" end="00:12:52.859" style="s2">Say hi.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.979" end="00:12:52.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re nice.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.299" end="00:13:04.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice to finally meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.019" end="00:13:12.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ooh.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.139" end="00:13:12.179" style="s2">He&#39;s precocious.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.939" end="00:13:16.544" style="s2">I just</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.524" end="00:13:16.544" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.739" end="00:13:22.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what the [ __ ] I&#39;m doing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.819" end="00:13:24.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what? You&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.819" end="00:13:27.139" style="s2">Why don&#39;t we just start simple? Let me</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.699" end="00:13:28.899" style="s2">go grab some takeout from Coney and</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.139" end="00:13:31.659" style="s2">we&#39;ll teach him how to play rummy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.899" end="00:13:31.659" style="s2">How does that sound?</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.979" end="00:13:36.219" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.819" end="00:13:42.499" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.659" end="00:13:42.499" style="s2">I&#39;ll come by first thing in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.499" end="00:13:47.739" style="s2">You&#39;re here now, Ray. You better get</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.059" end="00:13:49.299" style="s2">used to seeing my face.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.739" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">Are you going to stay here or with</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.299" end="00:13:52.659" style="s2">Amanda and Burke?</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:54.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, we&#39;re going to stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.659" end="00:13:55.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.539" end="00:13:58.619" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.979" end="00:13:58.619" style="s2">All right then.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.339" end="00:14:03.859" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.439" end="00:14:17.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.341" end="00:14:24.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s time to go to sleep now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.341" end="00:14:32.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we going to put Mommy in the ground?</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.861" end="00:14:36.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s enough now, Lawrence.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.089" end="00:14:40.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.981" end="00:14:41.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time to go to sleep. You&#39;re tired.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.421" end="00:14:43.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.301" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you are.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.261" end="00:14:46.901" style="s2">I&#39;m going to be sleeping right here next</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:49.541" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.901" end="00:14:49.541" style="s2">Go to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.581" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">Have I ever let you down?</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.861" end="00:15:25.621" style="s2">If we do this,</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.661" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">you got to deliver.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.621" end="00:15:31.181" style="s2">Cuz if you don&#39;t,</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:31.181" style="s2">Dempsey&#39;s going to wipe us off the map.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.941" end="00:15:37.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Shelly.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.261" end="00:15:38.141" style="s2">Two up?</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.221" end="00:15:40.261" style="s2">And a cup?</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.141" end="00:15:40.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.581" end="00:15:48.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] Colorado.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.581" end="00:15:50.061" style="s2">Let me make one call. First truck&#39;s on</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.861" end="00:15:52.621" style="s2">the road in 5 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.061" end="00:15:55.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me the bad guy, Bernie.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.621" end="00:15:55.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a yes.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.616" end="00:16:18.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.022" end="00:16:30.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was your friend?</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.702" end="00:16:30.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, we met on social media.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.622" end="00:16:43.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I help you with something, Bernie?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.182" end="00:16:43.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you&#39;re back in town.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.822" end="00:16:47.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.622" end="00:16:53.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I heard Maisie Connaly met her maker</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.782" end="00:16:53.382" style="s2">in the form of an F-150.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.022" end="00:17:00.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I figured somebody who knows how hard it</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.782" end="00:17:03.582" style="s2">is to lose somebody would be a little</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.422" end="00:17:03.582" style="s2">bit more empathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.422" end="00:17:08.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t talk about her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.982" end="00:18:11.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How you doing, bud?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.582" end="00:18:17.942" style="s2">Lawrence.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.382" end="00:18:19.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look pretty, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.942" end="00:18:23.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus Christ, what are you doing? You</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.983" end="00:18:23.103" style="s2">don&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.503" end="00:18:30.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why am I born this time, Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.343" end="00:18:32.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cuz your mom and I asked for you, bud.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.892" end="00:18:32.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.863" end="00:18:39.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to yell at you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.183" end="00:18:43.663" style="s2">I&#39;m here, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.663" end="00:18:47.423" style="s2">Do you hear me, bud?</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.623" end="00:18:52.543" style="s2">Let&#39;s get you dressed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.583" end="00:18:57.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Mama going to be at the party?</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.127" end="00:18:57.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.063" end="00:19:00.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.503" end="00:19:13.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some old rounder come along, [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.983" end="00:19:15.303" style="s2">took my sugar baby and gone.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.343" end="00:19:20.143" style="s2">And I ain&#39;t [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.303" end="00:19:20.143" style="s2">got no sugar baby</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.463" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">now. No, I</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.423" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">ain&#39;t got no sugar baby now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.063" end="00:19:34.383" style="s2">Give her</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.583" end="00:19:36.103" style="s2">every cent I made, and I laid her in the</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.383" end="00:19:40.823" style="s2">shade.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.103" end="00:19:42.943" style="s2">And I ain&#39;t [singing] got no sugar baby</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.823" end="00:19:44.253" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.943" end="00:19:45.103" style="s2">No, I ain&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.253" end="00:19:50.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.103" end="00:19:50.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; got no sugar baby now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.703" end="00:19:59.503" style="s2">Tried all I can [singing] do to [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.063" end="00:20:01.938" style="s2">make peace with you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.503" end="00:20:02.703" style="s2">I&#39;ll send you to your mama</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.938" end="00:20:05.783" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.703" end="00:20:05.783" style="s2">next payday.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.743" end="00:20:13.143" style="s2">Oh, I&#39;ll send you to your mama next</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.023" end="00:20:13.143" style="s2">payday.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.703" end="00:20:20.383" style="s2">And it&#39;s [music] who</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.183" end="00:20:22.423" style="s2">call you honey, and it&#39;s who will sing</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.383" end="00:20:23.554" style="s2">this song.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.423" end="00:20:24.263" style="s2">And it&#39;s who</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.554" end="00:20:25.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.263" end="00:20:26.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can cradle [singing]</p>
