<p begin="00:57:49.289" end="00:57:52.569" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry I wasn&#39;t there for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.409" end="00:57:56.289" style="s2">All right, look I need you to let go of</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.569" end="00:57:56.289" style="s2">him now. You ain&#39;t taking my baby girl.</p>
