<p begin="00:59:55.851" end="00:59:59.931" style="s2">me much of an option.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.131" end="01:00:01.371" style="s2">Ray, I I want to thank you for choosing</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:03.491" style="s2">to do this. I think that you&#39;ll find</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.371" end="01:00:05.011" style="s2">that this helps you as much as it helps</p>
