<p begin="01:00:09.011" end="01:00:12.331" style="s2">It&#39;s like memory. You know, that old</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.011" end="01:00:13.331" style="s2">board game?</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.331" end="01:00:14.731" style="s2">Maybe you played it when you were a</p>
