<p begin="01:06:13.375" end="01:06:15.895" style="s2">What do you think was going to happen</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.255" end="01:06:17.335" style="s2">with your little stunt here, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.895" end="01:06:18.615" style="s2">I swear to God, anything happens to my</p>
