<p begin="01:06:59.735" end="01:07:04.615" style="s2">that fast, Caroline.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.975" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll meet you there, Norman.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.615" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">Just want a word with your boy.</p>
