<p begin="01:09:46.578" end="01:09:49.297" style="s2">what you know.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.217" end="01:09:54.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They ain&#39;t going to believe I just put</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:54.217" style="s2">her on a bus.</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.738" end="01:09:56.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.338" end="01:10:01.498" style="s2">I&#39;ll take being a lousy lawman and you</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.458" end="01:10:03.898" style="s2">being a son of a [ __ ] over letting them</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.498" end="01:10:05.617" style="s2">hang you for this.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.898" end="01:10:08.258" style="s2">We&#39;re talking about the goddamn Colemans</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.617" end="01:10:08.258" style="s2">here, Marty.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.858" end="01:10:11.578" style="s2">I want you to come back to the precinct</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.418" end="01:10:14.657" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.578" end="01:10:16.137" style="s2">Only way I know you&#39;ll be safe.</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.657" end="01:10:17.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I go hiding at the precinct, I might as</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.137" end="01:10:21.218" style="s2">well put a guilty sign on my chest.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.778" end="01:10:21.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have to trust me on this one.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.657" end="01:10:28.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caroline, come in.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.858" end="01:10:31.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief,</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.898" end="01:10:35.018" style="s2">Chief, I&#39;m pulling up now.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.698" end="01:10:35.018" style="s2">Looks like some kind of barn.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.218" end="01:10:38.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m on my way.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.738" end="01:10:44.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you get to the precinct? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.738" end="01:10:45.938" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t ask if I had somebody else.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.137" end="01:10:47.338" style="s2">Best case scenario, we bring Bernie in</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.938" end="01:10:49.743" style="s2">and you get to listen to one of Marty&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.338" end="01:10:49.743" style="s2">sermons. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.418" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.018" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">Just stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.418" end="01:11:10.898" style="s2">You let me deal with [music] Bernie</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.418" end="01:11:10.898" style="s2">Coleman.</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.617" end="01:11:27.379" style="s2">Come on, Bud. Let&#39;s get you sorted.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.498" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">Grandma&#39;s I&#39;ve your favorite pancakes in</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.379" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">the car all ready for you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.939" end="01:11:35.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you to talk to him. Find out when</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.779" end="01:11:35.219" style="s2">you can.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.179" end="01:11:40.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on if you&#39;re coming.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.840" end="01:12:16.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.735" end="01:12:22.755" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.695" end="01:12:43.715" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.105" end="01:12:58.125" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.939" end="01:13:08.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.859" end="01:13:14.419" style="s2">Chief,</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.779" end="01:13:14.419" style="s2">there&#39;s no one here. We got to get back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.890" end="01:13:28.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.900" end="01:14:02.460" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pastor.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.180" end="01:14:07.900" style="s2">You have a gun?</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.900" end="01:14:28.460" style="s2">You alone?</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.300" end="01:14:32.660" style="s2">Now, open the god damn door.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.420" end="01:14:57.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, I want to talk about where you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.660" end="01:14:57.380" style="s2">seen the pastor before, Lawrence.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.420" end="01:15:04.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the woods.</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.980" end="01:15:09.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In what woods, Lawrence?</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.377" end="01:15:31.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.582" end="01:15:55.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I served this community for 30 years.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.702" end="01:15:56.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you have.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.502" end="01:15:59.507" style="s2">And I know that you&#39;re not a violent</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.862" end="01:16:01.502" style="s2">man, Marty.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.507" end="01:16:04.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.502" end="01:16:04.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bernie Coleman</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.942" end="01:16:08.662" style="s2">is not the type to listen to reason.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.952" end="01:16:13.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.982" end="01:16:21.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You believe your boy?</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.662" end="01:16:21.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what I believe anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.262" end="01:16:40.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pastor,</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.782" end="01:16:41.942" style="s2">I need you to get someplace [music] safe</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.182" end="01:16:44.422" style="s2">and hide.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.942" end="01:16:44.422" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.382" end="01:17:00.182" style="s2">You don&#39;t want to do this.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.422" end="01:17:01.142" style="s2">This is not going to end well if you</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.182" end="01:17:03.662" style="s2">make me come in there.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.142" end="01:17:03.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.142" end="01:17:08.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.222" end="01:17:09.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s good where he is.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.382" end="01:17:11.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God damn it, Bernie.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.502" end="01:17:12.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want him in the same room, and I want</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.062" end="01:17:14.502" style="s2">to hear him say it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.782" end="01:17:15.462" style="s2">You ask him.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.502" end="01:17:18.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right here.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.462" end="01:17:21.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not like this. I said I want the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.382" end="01:17:21.422" style="s2">I&#39;m going to get it here.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.022" end="01:17:24.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put the gun down.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.622" end="01:17:34.382" style="s2">You know, Gordon is going to be pulling</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.782" end="01:17:35.543" style="s2">up any second now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.382" end="01:17:38.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think his brothers will give me a</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.543" end="01:17:38.183" style="s2">fair say?</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.263" end="01:17:42.703" style="s2">You&#39;re on the clock here, Raymond.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.623" end="01:17:54.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.623" end="01:18:05.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I take you to him. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.223" end="01:18:06.578" style="s2">They stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.223" end="01:18:07.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just want answers.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.578" end="01:18:10.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.103" end="01:18:10.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it, Bernie.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.343" end="01:18:14.463" style="s2">No guns.</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.663" end="01:18:14.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Including yours.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.863" end="01:18:21.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You take my van.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.623" end="01:18:32.583" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus,</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.383" end="01:18:34.063" style="s2">please don&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.583" end="01:18:35.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.063" end="01:18:37.419" style="s2">Please don&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.399" end="01:18:37.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.289" end="01:19:02.309" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.783" end="01:19:08.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.143" end="01:19:10.824" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.804" end="01:19:10.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.664" end="01:19:18.684" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.905" end="01:19:23.925" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.263" end="01:19:33.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure you don&#39;t want to play,</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.623" end="01:19:35.343" style="s2">baby?</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.863" end="01:19:39.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.343" end="01:19:39.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, he&#39;ll be back for you bud.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.945" end="01:19:46.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda,</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.344" end="01:19:49.425" style="s2">I want you to get him in the back.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.864" end="01:19:49.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawrence.</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.505" end="01:20:00.104" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.860" end="01:20:03.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.065" end="01:20:13.624" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.704" end="01:20:16.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray, this has gone way too far.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.624" end="01:20:16.344" style="s2">He&#39;s unarmed.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.425" end="01:20:33.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raymond.</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.824" end="01:20:38.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.945" end="01:20:43.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.264" end="01:20:49.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you all are doing this isn&#39;t right.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.465" end="01:20:53.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.905" end="01:20:55.184" style="s2">baby girl, July.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.344" end="01:20:56.104" style="s2">Come come come come come closer.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.184" end="01:20:56.704" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you half-wit.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.104" end="01:20:57.985" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.704" end="01:21:00.784" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is insane.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.985" end="01:21:00.784" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.144" end="01:21:04.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do we do this?</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.025" end="01:21:06.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to hear it</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.744" end="01:21:07.224" style="s2">from him and I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.144" end="01:21:09.664" style="s2">want to hear what he saw.</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.224" end="01:21:11.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please be quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.664" end="01:21:14.385" style="s2">Lawrence,</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.144" end="01:21:14.385" style="s2">do you recognize this man?</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.784" end="01:21:17.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you do?</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.385" end="01:21:20.264" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray, please.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.945" end="01:21:22.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawrence, look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.264" end="01:21:26.744" style="s2">Did he hurt July?</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.864" end="01:21:26.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a child&#39;s imagination.</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.824" end="01:21:31.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right, bud.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.385" end="01:21:37.065" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.585" end="01:21:38.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hurt her.</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.065" end="01:21:40.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think for one moment this man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.425" end="01:21:42.131" style="s2">going to let me live?</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.111" end="01:21:42.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.344" end="01:21:46.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you willing to carry that?</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.666" end="01:21:47.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawrence, did he kill July?</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.225" end="01:21:48.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MOTHER [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.546" end="01:21:51.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BERNIE!</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.946" end="01:21:51.745" style="s2">BERNIE! BERNIE, NO!</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.066" end="01:21:52.586" style="s2">OH [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.745" end="01:21:53.106" style="s2">BERNIE!</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.586" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">NO, NO!</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.106" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO!</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.785" end="01:22:10.026" style="s2">RAY!</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.481" end="01:22:17.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.167" end="01:22:35.187" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.372" end="01:22:42.392" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.267" end="01:22:48.287" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.162" end="01:22:54.182" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.677" end="01:23:02.697" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.227" end="01:23:09.247" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.385" end="01:23:13.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RAY!</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.812" end="01:23:13.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.705" end="01:23:17.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.292" end="01:23:24.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.546" end="01:23:35.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RAY!</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.426" end="01:23:35.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LAWRENCE!</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.066" end="01:23:39.066" style="s2">LAWRENCE!</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.562" end="01:23:46.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.667" end="01:23:49.187" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LARS!</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.347" end="01:24:11.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.947" end="01:24:18.227" style="s2">Never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.147" end="01:24:18.227" style="s2">Never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.587" end="01:24:24.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ain&#39;t going to touch her, Ray.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.387" end="01:24:26.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay, Bernie.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.427" end="01:24:28.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray, don&#39;t take another god damn step.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.547" end="01:24:29.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not your fault.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.587" end="01:24:32.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray!</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.907" end="01:24:32.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She loved you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.947" end="01:24:40.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lars!</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.547" end="01:24:59.067" style="s2">Lars!</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.467" end="01:25:08.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay, bud?</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.987" end="01:25:08.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go in there, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.867" end="01:25:12.627" style="s2">Don&#39;t go in there.</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.629" end="01:26:12.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.149" end="01:26:52.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to see your hands, Pastor. Now.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.229" end="01:27:02.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To trust</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.829" end="01:27:03.908" style="s2">the words of a child.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.349" end="01:27:04.829" style="s2">For they are the keepers of the divine</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.908" end="01:27:06.469" style="s2">light.</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.829" end="01:27:09.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marty.</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.469" end="01:27:09.749" style="s2">Jesus Christ.</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.948" end="01:27:13.029" style="s2">Stand down, Caroline.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.269" end="01:27:14.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; no business being in this town. That I</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.029" end="01:27:16.349" style="s2">told her.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.629" end="01:27:19.669" style="s2">She was better.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.349" end="01:27:19.669" style="s2">She should see the world.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.869" end="01:27:23.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marty. Don&#39;t say another word.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.829" end="01:27:24.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I loved her.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.428" end="01:27:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marty, listen.</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.989" end="01:27:25.908" style="s2">Marty.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.509" end="01:27:27.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I loved</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.908" end="01:27:30.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ambulance is on the way, Marty.</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.989" end="01:27:30.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I loved her.</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.469" end="01:27:38.069" style="s2">I tried. I put her on that bus, Gordie.</p>
