<p begin="01:36:13.396" end="01:36:16.595" style="s2">&quot;I want [music] you back.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:36:15.075" end="01:36:19.716" style="s2">She said,</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.595" end="01:36:22.796" style="s2">&quot;I&#39;m never coming home to you.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.716" end="01:36:25.876" style="s2">Never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.796" end="01:36:29.196" style="s2">Never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.876" end="01:36:29.196" style="s2">Never coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.515" end="01:36:33.555" style="s2">Now the [music] skies [singing] are</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.915" end="01:36:36.635" style="s2">turning,</p>
<p begin="01:36:33.555" end="01:36:38.781" style="s2">and all the winds are stirring.</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.635" end="01:36:40.955" style="s2">Our love is stuck now. It&#39;s so messed</p>
